""" Plugin verbs which-key cannot label (single keys / non-prefix):
"""   s              flash jump
"""   W / E / B      camel + snake_case word motions
"""   af / if        function text object (functiontextobj)
"""   ae / ie        entire-buffer text object (textobj-entire)
"""   ai / ii        indent text object (textobj-indent)
"""   aa / ia        argument text object (argtextobj)
"""   gr / grr       replace with register (ReplaceWithRegister)
"""   crs crc crm cru  snake / camel / mixed / upper coercion (abolish)
"""   %              matchit-aware pair jump
"""   <M-h/j/k/l>    harpoon slots 1-4

" Multi-caret (IDEA native — replaces the multiple-cursors emulation)
nmap <A-n> <Action>(SelectNextOccurrence)
xmap <A-n> <Action>(SelectNextOccurrence)
nmap <A-p> <Action>(UnselectPreviousOccurrence)
xmap <A-p> <Action>(UnselectPreviousOccurrence)
nmap <A-a> <Action>(SelectAllOccurrences)
xmap <A-a> <Action>(SelectAllOccurrences)
nmap <A-Down> <Action>(EditorCloneCaretBelow)
nmap <A-Up> <Action>(EditorCloneCaretAbove)

" Pane navigation
nnoremap <C-h> <C-w>h
nnoremap <C-l> <C-w>l
nnoremap <C-k> <C-w>k
nnoremap <C-j> <C-w>j

" Jump between methods
nnoremap [[ <Action>(MethodUp)
nnoremap ]] <Action>(MethodDown)

" Popup navigation
imap <C-j> <Action>(PopupMenu-selectNext)
imap <C-k> <Action>(PopupMenu-selectPrevious)

" Word navigation in CamelCase and snake_case
map W [w
map E ]w
map B [b

" Prev / Next (unified with the vim jumplist via `set unifyjumps`)
nmap <C-Down> <Action>(Forward)
nmap <C-Right> <Action>(Forward)
nmap <C-Up> <Action>(Back)
nmap <C-Left> <Action>(Back)

" LSP-style bare-g keys, matching nvim muscle memory.
" NOTE: gd / gD already resolve declarations natively in IdeaVim, and the
" gr* prefix belongs to ReplaceWithRegister, so only these two are added.
nmap K <Action>(ShowHoverInfo)
nmap gO <Action>(FileStructurePopup)


